# Market: markets and their walls, things, a wallet, and what one holds in escrow.

SCREEN Agora ABOUT Alice:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Alice: identity, person
    LIST Markets: "Alice is a member of the market Mart of Bob" OPENS Market
    LIST Wall: "Alice sees Bob's post of Item on the wall of Mart" OPENS Post
    LIST Things: FROM item WITH made OPENS Thing
    LIST Wallet: "Alice holds Sum Carol-notes of type Type" OPENS Note
    LIST In escrow: "Alice holds Sum Dave-notes of type Type in escrow from Bob for Carol on Cond" OPENS Escrow
    LIST Items in escrow: "Alice holds the item Item in escrow from Bob for Carol on Cond" OPENS Held
    LIST People: EVERYONE WITH knows, has_member, delivered_post OPENS Person
    Establish: Alice may establish an identity
    Acquaint: Alice and Bob may jointly come to know each other, Bob TYPED
    Make: Alice may make the item Item, Item TYPED
    Open: Alice may open Mart under a new name of hers, Mart TYPED
    Issue: Alice may issue Sum Alice-notes of type Type, Type TYPED, Sum TYPED
    Withdraw: Alice may withdraw her post of Item in Bob's Mart, Bob TYPED, Item TYPED, Mart TYPED

SCREEN Market ABOUT "Alice is a member of the market Mart of Bob":
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Mart: keeper, has_member, posted
    Offer: Alice may post Item to the wall of Bob's Mart, Item FROM item
    Offer own: Alice may post Item to the wall of Alice's Mart, Item FROM item
    Want: Alice may post Wish to the wall of Bob's Mart, Wish TYPED
    Want own: Alice may post Wish to the wall of Alice's Mart, Wish TYPED

SCREEN Post ABOUT "Alice sees Bob's post of Item on the wall of Mart":
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW: post, delivered_post
    Withdraw own: Alice may withdraw her post of Item in Alice's Mart
    Swap items: Alice and Bob may jointly swap the item Item2 for the item Item, Item2 FROM item

SCREEN Thing ABOUT Item:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Item: item, made
    Swap items: Alice and Bob may jointly swap the item Item for the item Thing, Bob FROM knows, Thing TYPED
    Swap item for coin: Alice and Bob may jointly swap the item Item for Sum Dave-coins, Bob FROM knows, Dave TYPED, Sum TYPED
    Swap item for bond: Alice and Bob may jointly swap the item Item for Sum Dave-bonds due Day, Bob FROM knows, Dave TYPED, Sum TYPED
    Deposit item: Alice may deposit the item Item with Carol for Bob on Cond, Carol FROM knows, Bob FROM knows, Cond TYPED

SCREEN Note ABOUT "Alice holds Sum Carol-notes of type Type":
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW: note
    Pay: Alice may pay Bob Sum Carol-notes of type Type, Bob FROM knows, Sum TYPED
    Pay issuer: Bob IS Carol, Sum TYPED
    Swap: Alice and Bob may jointly swap Sum Carol-notes of type Type for Total Dave-notes of type Other, Sum TYPED, Bob FROM knows, Dave TYPED, Other TYPED, Total TYPED
    Deposit: Alice may deposit Sum Carol-notes of type Type with Bob for Dave on Cond, Sum TYPED, Bob FROM knows, Dave FROM knows, Cond TYPED
    Redeem: Alice may redeem a Carol-coin against a Bob-coin, Bob TYPED
    Redeem coin against bond: Alice may redeem a Carol-coin against a Bob-bond due Day, Bob TYPED
    Redeem bond: Alice may redeem a Carol-bond due Day against a Bob-coin, Bob TYPED
    Redeem bond against bond: Alice may redeem a Carol-bond due Day against a Bob-bond due Term, Bob TYPED

SCREEN Escrow ABOUT "Alice holds Sum Dave-notes of type Type in escrow from Bob for Carol on Cond":
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW: escrow_note
    Release: Alice and Carol may jointly release Sum Dave-notes of type Type that Bob deposited on Cond, Sum TYPED
    Return: Alice and Bob may jointly return Sum Dave-notes of type Type deposited for Carol on Cond, Sum TYPED

SCREEN Held ABOUT "Alice holds the item Item in escrow from Bob for Carol on Cond":
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW: escrow_item
    Release item: Alice and Carol may jointly release the item Item that Bob deposited on Cond
    Return item: Alice and Bob may jointly return the item Item deposited for Carol on Cond

SCREEN Person ABOUT Bob:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Bob: knows, has_member, delivered_post
    Introduce: Alice may introduce Carol to Bob, Carol FROM knows
    Introduce: Alice may introduce Bob to Carol, Carol FROM knows
    Join: Alice may admit Bob to Mart, Mart FROM keeper
